fan_lut.json from research/lut_sweep_2026-10-09.csv (i9-13980HX, RTX 4080
Laptop GPU): GPU 30 % up to ~42 °C, 60 % from ~47 °C (100 % never beat 60 %
by more than 1 °C); CPU 30 % up to 58 °C, 100 % from 84 °C (0 % fan
throttled 85 % of the time at full load). The CPU rows between 58 and 84 °C
rest on noisy duty-cycled loads; the README says so. The CPU guard section
moves after the fan-curve daemon's text, which it had split.

